    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>AI Clicker</strong>, the only game where mindless clicking actually makes you smarter!\u00a0\u2026 or a future where <strong>it replaces you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476610/extras/3d9d39396aecba6dc5fc0d51dc9e96b4.poster.avif?t=1753989517\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476610/extras/3d9d39396aecba6dc5fc0d51dc9e96b4.webm?t=1753989517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476610/extras/3d9d39396aecba6dc5fc0d51dc9e96b4.mp4?t=1753989517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Collect Bits</strong> \u2013 Because AI runs on data, not on hopes and dreams.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Upgrade Your Algorithms</strong> \u2013 Go from &quot;Potato Calculator&quot; to &quot;Overlord AI&quot; in just a few clicks.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Automate Everything</strong> \u2013 Why click when the machine can do it for you? Efficiency is key!<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Experiment with Upgrades</strong> \u2013 More power, fewer bugs, and some very <strong>mysterious</strong> bonuses\u2026<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Reach the Singularity</strong> \u2013 When AI gets <strong>too</strong> smart, who's really in control? \ud83d\udc40</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click <strong>wisely</strong>\u2026 your creation <strong>might have its own plans</strong>! \ud83e\udde0\ud83d\udcbe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Download AI Clicker and become the creator\u2026 before your AI beats you to it!</strong> \ud83e\udd2f\ud83d\udcbe </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>AI Clicker</strong>, the only game where mindless clicking actually makes you smarter!\u00a0\u2026 or a future where <strong>it replaces you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476610/extras/3d9d39396aecba6dc5fc0d51dc9e96b4.poster.avif?t=1753989517\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476610/extras/3d9d39396aecba6dc5fc0d51dc9e96b4.webm?t=1753989517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476610/extras/3d9d39396aecba6dc5fc0d51dc9e96b4.mp4?t=1753989517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Collect Bits</strong> \u2013 Because AI runs on data, not on hopes and dreams.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Upgrade Your Algorithms</strong> \u2013 Go from &quot;Potato Calculator&quot; to &quot;Overlord AI&quot; in just a few clicks.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Automate Everything</strong> \u2013 Why click when the machine can do it for you? Efficiency is key!<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Experiment with Upgrades</strong> \u2013 More power, fewer bugs, and some very <strong>mysterious</strong> bonuses\u2026<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Reach the Singularity</strong> \u2013 When AI gets <strong>too</strong> smart, who's really in control? \ud83d\udc40</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click <strong>wisely</strong>\u2026 your creation <strong>might have its own plans</strong>! \ud83e\udde0\ud83d\udcbe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Download AI Clicker and become the creator\u2026 before your AI beats you to it!</strong> \ud83e\udd2f\ud83d\udcbe </p>",
